<title>FRANCE: France approves GEC-Alsthom/Framatome merger talks.</title>
<headline>France approves GEC-Alsthom/Framatome merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French government gave its blessing on Friday to plans by Alcatel Alsthom and Britain's General Electric Co to study a possible merger between their joint venture company GEC-Alsthom and France's state controlled nuclear power plant maker Framatome.</p>
<p>&quot;The state gives its authorisation for the public shareholders of Framatome to take part in the merger study,&quot; the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
</text>
